  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "All twelve variants materialize through production enemy definitions, stats, phases, abilities and AI graphs.",
    "The pre-existing exact Voidranger Reaver identity is upgraded in place and covered at every S17 encounter level.",
    "Trotters retain Scared, Run and Escaped action order plus their Abundance, Destruction or Preservation passive state.",
    "Thunderspawn retains Lightning damage, Shock, Lightning resistance and Shock immunity.",
    "Vagrant retains its 250% Physical attack and ally Inspire action advance.",
    "Distorter retains Nihility's Command and 500% Quantum strike boundaries.",
    "Eliminator retains Detonated, Overloaded and Thermal Barrier boundaries.",
    "The bug Trampler retains its extracted 800% End of Bow ratio, lock and Entanglement.",
    "No native handler is introduced."
  ]
